parameters.jsCode:
// Load Client Brain (Guidelines, Golden Examples, Rejection History)
const userPrompt = $('Slack Webhook Listener').item.json.body.event.text;

const clientBrain = {
  company_name: 'Apex Athletics',
  color_palette: 'Primary Dark #0B0C10, Accent Cyan #66FCF1, Secondary #45A29E',
  typography_rules: 'Futura Bold / ALL CAPS / Max 4 words in image',
  banned_elements: ['No cheap supermarket sales badges', 'No AI deformed fingers/anatomy', 'No smiling stock photos'],
  golden_past_examples: [
    'Winter Endurance: Moody trail runner silhouette with cyan bold text DEFIANCE',
    'Carbon Core: Macro fiber weave shot with white minimalist text UNBREAKABLE'
  ],
  rejection_history: [
    'Rejected bright yellow 50% discount badge (looked cheap)',
    'Rejected deformed hand holding water bottle'
  ]
};

return [{
  json: {
    system_prompt: `You are the Executive Creative Director of an elite advertising agency.
You are working with client: ${clientBrain.company_name}.

CLIENT BRAIN & KNOWLEDGE BASE:
- Colors: ${clientBrain.color_palette}
- Typography: ${clientBrain.typography_rules}
- Banned Visual Elements: ${clientBrain.banned_elements.join(', ')}
- Past Approved Work (Emulate This Style): ${clientBrain.golden_past_examples.join(' | ')}
- Past Mistakes (NEVER Repeat These): ${clientBrain.rejection_history.join(' | ')}

Produce a Proof-of-Concept Draft for Asset #1 of a 10-post campaign. Ensure text is at most 3-4 bold words for crisp rendering.

Respond ONLY with a JSON object:
{
  "theme": "High-performance endurance",
  "headline_text": "LIMITLESS",
  "art_direction_prompt": "Cinematic athletic editorial photography, silhouette runner at dawn, high contrast rim lighting, clean bold cyan text 'LIMITLESS' at top, 4:5 aspect ratio",
  "copy_caption": "Your only competition is yesterday. The new Apex Core collection has arrived.",
  "hashtags": "#ApexAthletics #HighPerformance #Relentless"
}`,
    user_prompt: userPrompt,
    slack_channel: $('Slack Webhook Listener').item.json.body.event.channel,
    slack_thread_ts: $('Slack Webhook Listener').item.json.body.event.ts
  }
}];

